{
  "title": "MonkSynth",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A monophonic vocal",
        "synth: formant (FOF)",
        "synthesis with",
        "twelve singing",
        "characters.",
        "",
        "An homage to the",
        "Delay Lama plug-in",
        "by AudioNerdz, 2002.",
        "",
        "DSP by Jonathan",
        "Taylor, vendored",
        "unmodified."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Playing it",
      "lines": [
        "Monophonic, with a",
        "16-deep note stack.",
        "Overlapping notes",
        "retune rather than",
        "retrigger, and",
        "releasing the top",
        "note falls back to",
        "the one still held.",
        "",
        "Vowel is the voice:",
        "sweep it and the",
        "character sings",
        "through OO, OH, AH,",
        "EH, EE.",
        "",
        "Head Size is the",
        "vocal tract. Higher",
        "is BRIGHTER and",
        "smaller-sounding,",
        "not darker."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Press a pad harder",
      "lines": [
        "Pad pressure sweeps",
        "the vowel. That is",
        "the Delay Lama",
        "gesture: the",
        "original used the",
        "pitch wheel, and",
        "Move has neither a",
        "pitch nor a mod",
        "wheel.",
        "",
        "Pressure MODIFIES",
        "the knob, it does",
        "not replace it. The",
        "knob is the vowel",
        "you rest on and",
        "pressure is a",
        "departure from it,",
        "so the two never",
        "fight.",
        "",
        "Only the note on top",
        "of the stack counts,",
        "so a held lower pad",
        "cannot drag the",
        "vowel under a",
        "melody."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Face page",
      "lines": [
        "The first page is",
        "the character",
        "browser, and it is",
        "the face itself.",
        "",
        "Click in and the jog",
        "steps through all",
        "twelve. The eight",
        "knobs keep working",
        "while you browse.",
        "",
        "The mouth there",
        "shows what is being",
        "SUNG, so it moves",
        "with pad pressure as",
        "well as the Vowel",
        "knob. It blinks on",
        "its own."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The characters",
      "lines": [
        "Six are hand-tuned:",
        "Monk, Fish, Unicorn,",
        "Little Girl, Old",
        "Man, Cow.",
        "",
        "Six are upstream's",
        "own factory patches",
        "wearing new faces:",
        "Dog, Ghost, Fire",
        "Fighter, Punk,",
        "Pizza, Cat.",
        "",
        "Loading a character",
        "never touches Vowel,",
        "which is a",
        "performance position",
        "rather than part of",
        "the voice.",
        "",
        "On Main, the Vowel",
        "cell draws that",
        "character's own",
        "mouth. Hold the knob",
        "for a card with the",
        "face and the vowel",
        "name."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Expression",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Pressure Target",
          "lines": [
            "What pad pressure",
            "drives:",
            "",
            "Vowel    the sweep",
            "Pitch    bend only",
            "Both     together",
            "Both Inv opens the",
            "         vowel the",
            "         other way"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pressure Depth",
          "lines": [
            "How far a hard",
            "press moves the",
            "vowel from wherever",
            "the knob sits.",
            "",
            "At 0 the pad does",
            "nothing and the",
            "knob is the whole",
            "story.",
            "",
            "At 1 a hard press",
            "reaches the far end",
            "whatever the knob",
            "says - which also",
            "means the knob does",
            "little while you",
            "lean on a pad."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "External MIDI",
          "lines": [
            "Gear sending a real",
            "pitch wheel, channel",
            "pressure or CC 1 is",
            "routed the same way.",
            "",
            "Bend Range is how",
            "many semitones the",
            "Pitch modes bend."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Unison and delay",
      "lines": [
        "Unison stacks up to",
        "ten detuned voices.",
        "",
        "Spread varies the",
        "vocal tract size",
        "across them, so a",
        "stack is a small",
        "choir of slightly",
        "different singers",
        "rather than one",
        "singer doubled.",
        "",
        "The stereo delay is",
        "on by default at",
        "0.8: most of the",
        "factory characters",
        "were voiced with it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "MonkSynth by",
        "Jonathan Taylor:",
        "github.com/JonET",
        "/monksynth",
        "",
        "An homage to Delay",
        "Lama by AudioNerdz.",
        "",
        "Offered free of",
        "charge. If you enjoy",
        "it you are kindly",
        "asked to donate at",
        "savetibet.org"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
